Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: aws-lc
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/aws/aws-lc/issues
Source: https://github.com/aws/aws-lc
Comment: Repacked to drop the NIST FIPS 140 security policy PDFs (no source,
 redistribution terms unclear), the RFC 8032 text kept for the duvet
 requirement tool (IETF licence is not DFSG-free), and prebuilt binaries
 without source (CI gradle wrappers, object files used as test data by the
 Go ar tool). None of them is used to build.
Files-Excluded:
 crypto/fipsmodule/policydocs
 .duvet
 .github
 tests/ci/android
 util/ar/testdata

